Name: DevTools MCP Server
Short Name: mcp-server
URL: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-06-20
License: BSD-3-Clause
License File: Not provided
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
Browser-compatible MCP (Model Context Protocol) server implementation for
Chrome DevTools Timeline integration. This provides a simplified interface
for exposing DevTools functionality through the MCP protocol, allowing AI
assistants to interact with DevTools trace recording and analysis features.

This is a custom implementation designed specifically for the DevTools browser
context, not a direct dependency on the external MCP SDK.

Local Modifications:
- Created browser-compatible implementation without Node.js dependencies
- Simplified to work within DevTools UI context
- No external dependencies on the @modelcontextprotocol/sdk package